Modified for Sklubot (2026-11-22): rewritten for non-technical projects: a one- or two-screen brief (scenarios by priority, measurable success criteria, out of scope, at most three open questions, choices made), approval through ask_user and goal mode, a read-only check of the plan against the brief, and a final tick of each criterion with its proof; scripts, branches, hooks and code analysis removed; translated into French.
Only text is included; no script, picture or other file of the original folders is bundled. Names of other products are not used as titles.
